      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE DUX NUTS (3) is a useful sprinter back from an 11-week lay-off. One of his best efforts last prep was a very close third in a BM58 over this course and distance. Should have some residual fitness and he has the class to put this field away. SAMITA (5) had a six-week break before finishing third last start over today's journey at Mendooran. In the money at two of four runs over 1000m here. Nicely placed to play a pivotal role. MAXANDUS (1) dropped in grade and was second-up from a two-month break when runner-up over this distance at Collarenebri recently. Building a nice 1000m record and should be competitive again. YANABAH (2) is back after a five-month spell. Usually needs a run but he likes Tamworth and could be the surprise packet. OUR BOY TOM (4) also resumes. Placed at two of three when fresh so he should give a good account.",
